色的原野上，我的心里多么忧伤……”</i>","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_3/3_3_bg_01.jpg","choice":[]},"9":{"step":[[9,10,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["隐隐的歌声从河面传来，像是破冰的春水一样荡开了茫茫夜色。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_3/3_3_bg_01.jpg","choice":[]},"10":{"step":[[10,11,""]],"type":1,"name":["格里高利","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"531501.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["<i>“我听见那风在对我说……”</i>","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_3/3_3_bg_01.jpg","choice":[]},"11":{"step":[[11,12,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["一直沉默的士兵无意识地接了下去，声音微小如呢喃。但他很快受到了河对面歌声的鼓舞，声音越来越清晰地响了起来。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_3/3_3_bg_01.jpg","choice":[]},"12":{"step":[[12,13,""]],"type":1,"name":["格里高利","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"531501.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["<i>“我听见河流在对我唱，那河流告诉我……”</i>","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_3/3_3_bg_01.jpg","choice":[]},"13":{"step":[[13,14,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["和他的面孔不一样，唱歌的声音十分清亮婉转，如同一条银线高高抛入了空中。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_3/3_3_bg_01.jpg","choice":[]},"14":{"step":[[14,15,""]],"type":1,"name":["伊戈尔","","Igor","","","","",""],"head_icon":"309201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["<i>“那河流告诉我，小伙子再也不能回到家乡。”</i>","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_3/3_3_bg_01.jpg","choice":[]},"15":{"step":[[15,16,""]],"type":1,"name":["伊戈尔","","Igor","","","","",""],"head_icon":"309201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["你从哪儿学会这首歌的，中士？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_3/3_3_bg_01.jpg","choice":[]},"16":{"step":[[16,17,""]],"type":1,"name":["格里高利","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"531501.png","audio":"7208402","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["我祖父教给了我父亲，我父亲教给了我，将军。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_3/3_3_bg_01.jpg","choice":[]},"17":{"step":[[17,18,""]],"type":1,"name":["格里高利","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"531501.png","audio":"7208352","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["但他只来得及教我这一首歌。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_3/3_3_bg_01.jpg","choice":[]},"18":{"step":[[18,19,""]],"type":1,"name":["伊戈尔","","Igor","","","","",""],"head_icon":"309201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["你不仅会养马，还很会唱歌，中士。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_3/3_3_bg_01.jpg","choice":[]},"19":{"step":[[19,20,""]],"type":1,"name":["格里高利","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"531501.png","audio":"7208346","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["谢谢您，将军，我没想到您也会唱歌。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_3/3_3_bg_01.jpg","choice":[]},"20":{"step":[[20,21,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["士兵的惊讶十分直白，他的神色和歌声一样，逐渐放松了下来。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_3/3_3_bg_01.jpg","choice":[]},"21":{"step":[[21,22,""]],"type":1,"name":["伊戈尔","","Igor","","","","",""],"head_icon":"309201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["没有哥萨克不会唱歌。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_3/3_3_bg_01.jpg","choice":[]},"22":{"step":[[22,23,""]],"type":1,"name":["伊戈尔","","Igor","","","","",""],"head_icon":"309201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["以前如果仗打赢了，我和我的老伙计们就会唱那首不知道哪一辈传下来的古歌。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_3/3_3_bg_01.jpg","choice":[]},"23":{"step":[[23,24,""]],"type":1,"name":["伊戈尔","","Igor","","","","",""],"head_icon":"309201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["<i>“黑海掀起巨浪，战船亮如白昼。”</i>","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_3/3_3_bg_01.jpg","choice":[]},"24":{"step":[[24,25,""]],"type":1,"name":["伊戈尔","","Igor","","","","",""],"head_icon":"309201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["<i>“浇灭灯，击沉船，哥萨克要留名千古！”</i>","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_3/3_3_bg_01.jpg","choice":[]},"25":{"step":[[25,26,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["顿挫的曲调在空气中打着拍子。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_3/3_3_bg_01.jpg","choice":[]},"26":{"step":[[26,27,""]],"type":1,"name":["伊戈尔","","Igor","","","","",""],"head_icon":"309201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["这首歌得配着盘腿舞，但我一直不会跳舞。中士，你会跳舞吗？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_3/3_3_bg_01.jpg","choice":[]},"27":{"step":[[27,28,""]],"type":1,"name":["格里高利","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"531501.png","audio":"7208366","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["就算您拿枪指着我，我也没法让皮靴交替着离开地面一英寸，将军。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_3/3_3_bg_01.jpg","choice":[]},"28":{"step":[[28,29,""]],"type":1,"name":["伊戈尔","","Igor","","","","",""],"head_icon":"309201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["那我们在所有节日都会被姑娘冷落的，士兵。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_3/3_3_bg_01.jpg","choice":[]},"29":{"step":[[29,30,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["笑的余音散去之后，草原的空气骤然变冷。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_3/3_3_bg_01.jpg","choice":[]},"30":{"step":[[30,31,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["冷得像每一个战前的夜晚。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_3/3_3_bg_01.jpg","choice":[]},"31":{"step":[[31,32,""]],"type":1,"name":["伊戈尔","","Igor","","","","",""],"head_icon":"309201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["哥萨克藏不住秘密，心里想什么，只要听他唱的歌就明白了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_3/3_3_bg_01.jpg","choice":[]},"32":{"step":[[32,33,""]],"type":1,"name":["伊戈尔","","Igor","","","","",""],"head_icon":"309201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["如果明天的仗格外艰难，他们就会把自己灌得烂醉，然后唱起那首歌……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_3/3_3_bg_01.jpg","choice":[]},"33":{"step":[[33,34,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["将军吸了一口气，冰冷的空气带着百里香的味道充斥着他的肺部。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_3/3_3_bg_01.jpg","choice":[]},"34":{"step":[[34,35,""]],"type":1,"name":["伊戈尔","","Igor","","","","",""],"head_icon":"309201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["<i>“山那边寒风凛冽，冻伤了鸟儿的喉咙，树儿也打着寒颤。”</i>","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_3/3_3_bg_01.jpg","choice":[]},"35":{"step":[[35,36,""]],"type":1,"name":["伊戈尔","","Igor","","","","",""],"head_icon":"309201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["<i>“冬夜里大雪飘落，那厚厚的雪底下，埋着哥萨克的骨头……”</i>","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_3/3_3_bg_01.jpg","choice":[]},"36":{"step":[[36,37,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["渐黑","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/heiping.jpg","choice":[]},"37":{"step":[[37,38,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_